sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SO as Sell Offer Service
    participant BAL as Balance Service
    participant DB as Balance DB

    Note over SO: Every state change is also emitted as an audit event, asynchronously and off the trade path
    Note over SO: PHASE 1 - RESERVATION REQUEST (sync REST)
    SO ->> BAL: AssetReservationRequest ( supplier account, asset, volume, expiration)
    Note over BAL, DB: ONE database transaction, check and create are atomic per account
    BAL ->> DB: Eligible balance = EXECUTED credits + EXECUTED and REQUESTED debits
    alt Not enough assets
        BAL -->> SO: Rejected INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
        Note over SO: Reservation is not created
    else Enough assets
        BAL ->> DB: Insert Debit record REQUESTED (source type asset reservation, source id requestId, expiration)
        BAL -->> SO: Accepted debit record as reservation (debit record id, expiration)
        Note over SO: Creates the offer, its expiry is not later than the reservation expiration
        Note over SO, EXP: PHASE 2 - CONFIRMATION (async, outbox and CDC)
        SO -) BAL: OfferCreated (reservation id, offer id) - outbox row written with the offer, CDC, Kafka
        BAL ->> BAL: Idempotent by event id
        BAL ->> DB: In ONE transaction: Debit record REQUESTED to EXECUTED, only if not expired, outbox row
        alt Record still REQUESTED
            BAL -) SO: ReservationCompleted (reservation id, offer id) - outbox, CDC
        else Record expired or REJECTED
            BAL -) SO: ReservationRejected (reservation id, code) - outbox, CDC
        end
    end

    Note over BAL: The funds are free again by themselves, an expired record is not counted in the eligible balance